{{!--
  robots.txt (fifthbell/cronkite#156). Plain text, no HTML escaping: every value is
  a single line by the input schema (no control characters), so no value can add a
  directive. One group per rule in the given order, Allow lines before Disallow
  lines, then one Sitemap line per URL. The input schema requires at least one
  rule and every rule at least one Allow or Disallow line, so a document with no
  rules, or a group with neither, is refused instead of rendering an empty file
  or group that would allow everything.
--}}
{{#each rules}}
User-agent: {{{userAgent}}}
{{#each allow}}
Allow: {{{this}}}
{{/each}}
{{#each disallow}}
Disallow: {{{this}}}
{{/each}}

{{/each}}
{{#each sitemaps}}
Sitemap: {{{this}}}
{{/each}}
